<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Elec plans plasma-display investment.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Elec plans plasma-display investment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd said on Monday that it plans to invest 80 billion yen in plasma-display business by 2005.</p>
</text>
